        {en ? "Twenty-four named phenomena a client executive may raise — AI washing, shadow AI, the PoC-to-production wall, the bubble debate, Jevons paradox and more. Each card: what it is in boardroom language, why it happens structurally, the evidence within this app's sourcing, and a first-person answer you can give when asked in a meeting. Debates stay two-sided." : "役員から突然聞かれる24の事象・論争 — AIウォッシング、シャドーAI、PoC死、バブル論争、ジェバンズのパラドックスなど。各カードは「何か（役員に通じる定義）／なぜ起きるか（構造）／実例・数字（本アプリの出典範囲）／聞かれたときの答え方（そのまま言える一人称の型）」の4点。論争は両論併記で、断定しない。"}
