        {en ? "The working methods that carry an engagement from use-case discovery through PoC and quality assurance. Companion to the tacit-knowledge tab (which extracts judgment from experts): this tab supplies the process maps, scoring frames, measurement designs and evaluation methods around it. Scholarly and framework references summarize published sources; adapt everything to the engagement." : "案件を「発掘→検証→品質保証」まで運ぶ実務手法集。熟達者から判断を引き出す「暗黙知の形式知化」タブと対をなし、その周辺に必要なプロセス可視化・スコアリング・効果測定・評価設計を収める。フレームワークの記載は公開情報の要約であり、適用は案件に合わせて調整する。"}
